      "side": 1,
      "message": "My thoughts are that it may be better to use another type of volume than a hostPath.  We are moving towards running XOS on multi-node K8S clusters, and the use of hostPath would require either (1) knowing which node to populate the images on, or (2) populating the images on all nodes.\n\nAt any rate, it seems that there is some design work to do.  I propose that we commit the current chart as-is, and work on the image volume mount in a separate commit.",
